{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ab62a556-016e-4ce5-87b1-0ba704334bdd",
    "name": "Distributed KV Store API",
    "description": "# Distributed KV Store API\n\nIntegration tests for the Distributed Key-Value Store, an in-memory replicated database built in Go, deployed via Docker Compose (local) or AWS ECS Fargate with Cloud Map (AWS).\n\n## Getting Started\n\nThis collection uses Environment Variables for switching between Local and AWS targets.\n\n### Setup\n\n1. Import this collection into Postman.\n    \n2. Import the Local and AWS environments.\n    \n3. Select the appropriate environment from the top-right dropdown.\n    \n| Variable        | Local                   | AWS            |\n|-----------------|-------------------------|----------------|\n| `leaderUrl`     | `http://localhost:8081` | `http://:8081` |\n| `followerUrl`   | `http://localhost:8082` | `http://:8082` |\n| `leaderlessUrl` | `http://localhost:8091` | `http://:8091` |\n| `leaderlessUrl2`| `http://localhost:8092` | `http://:8092` |\n\n## Architectures\n\n### Leader-Follower (N=5)\n\n- lf1 (leader): port 8081\n    \n- lf2-lf5 (followers): ports 8082-8085\n    \n- Strategies: W5R1, W1R5, W3R3\n    \n\n### Leaderless (N=5, W=N, R=1)\n\n- ll1-ll5: ports 8091-8095\n    \n- Any node can coordinate writes\n    \n\n## Endpoints\n\n### Health\n\n- GET /health\n    \n\n### Key-Value Operations\n\n- POST /set\n    \n- GET /get?key=\n    \n- GET /local_read?key=\n    \n\n### Error Cases\n\n- POST /set with empty key (400)\n    \n- GET /get with missing key (400)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "52400206",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/52400206-ab62a556-016e-4ce5-87b1-0ba704334bdd?source=collection_link"
  },
